00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:18.670
Tuan, tolong.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:19.500
Saudara laki‑kakimu.

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:20.290
Juga Curtis.

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.080
Mereka masih di luar sana.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.960
Kita harus membantu mereka.

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:26.760
Kakak sangat menyesal, adik,
